<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!--
      Photonize is distributed as a GitHub DMG, not through the Mac App Store, so
      it is intentionally NOT sandboxed. The App Sandbox is only mandatory for MAS
      distribution (explicitly out of scope), and without a paid Developer ID its
      security-scoped bookmarks cannot be validated against a stable code-signing
      identity — so restoring the last folder, "Open With", and drag-in all failed
      under an ad-hoc signature and forced the user through Browse… every time.
      Dropping the sandbox lets the app open any folder the user navigates to.

      The hardened runtime is still enabled (ENABLE_HARDENED_RUNTIME in project.yml),
      which is what notarization requires; no entitlement exceptions are needed, so
      this dict is intentionally empty.
    -->
</dict>
</plist>
